---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Contact" description="Work with Yoneda Labs — AI agent systems, data platforms, and research engineering. Email mlong@magneton.io. Based in Chicago.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="mono-label">contact</p>
      <h1 class="section-title">What are you building?</h1>
      <p class="section-sub">
        Engagements typically start with a well-scoped problem: an agent system that must not
        hallucinate, a data platform that must not lose rows, a pipeline that must not fail.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container two-col">
      <div class="contact-cards">
        <a class="card contact-card" href="mailto:mlong@magneton.io">
          <span class="mono-label">email</span>
          <span class="contact-value">mlong@magneton.io</span>
          <span class="contact-note">Best first contact — include scope and timeline.</span>
        </a>
        <a class="card contact-card" href="/resume.pdf" download>
          <span class="mono-label">resume</span>
          <span class="contact-value">Resume_Matthew_Long.pdf ⬇</span>
          <span class="contact-note">Full track record: 20+ years, metrics, certifications.</span>
        </a>
        <a class="card contact-card" href="https://github.com/MagnetonIO" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <span class="mono-label">open source</span>
          <span class="contact-value">github.com/MagnetonIO ↗</span>
          <span class="contact-note">50+ public repositories across the lab's programs.</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <aside class="card">
        <h3 class="mono-label">good fits</h3>
        <ul class="fits">
          <li>Autonomous agent systems that must run unattended</li>
          <li>Semantic data layers over messy enterprise sources</li>
          <li>High-throughput data platforms (events, orders, telemetry)</li>
          <li>Formal methods — Lean 4, type systems, verification</li>
          <li>Applied research programs with publishable output</li>
        </ul>
        <h3 class="mono-label cred-gap">elsewhere</h3>
        <ul class="fits">
          <li><a href="https://yonedaai.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">yonedaai.com ↗</a> — research collective</li>
          <li><a href="https://grokrxiv.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">grokrxiv.org ↗</a> — agentic peer review</li>
          <li><a href="https://catdb.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener">catdb.ai ↗</a> · <a href="https://contextfs.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener">contextfs.ai ↗</a> · <a href="https://yonedarepo.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">yonedarepo.com ↗</a></li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .two-col {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .two-col { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  .contact-cards { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }
  .contact-card { gap: 6px; }
  .contact-card:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }
  .contact-value {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .contact-note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .cred-gap { margin-top: 22px; }
  .fits { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; margin-top: 12px; }
  .fits li {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    padding-left: 16px;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--border-strong);
  }
  .fits a { color: var(--accent); }
  .fits a:hover { color: var(--accent-soft); }
</style>
